{"id":"1262398c29560e42","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-gaifman.md","title":"无常量关系词汇上的 Gaifman 正规形式","display":"thm-gaifman — 无常量关系词汇上的 Gaifman 正规形式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-gaifman","aliases":["29-thm-gaifman"],"display":"thm-gaifman — 无常量关系词汇上的 Gaifman 正规形式","depends_on":["[[29-df-gaifman-normal-form]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Historical notes, p.111, DjVu scan 126; Gaifman (1982), original publication abstract","source_basis":"原书历史引文及原始论文机构记录摘要；完整证明未核验","source_url":"https://cris.huji.ac.il/en/publications/on-local-and-non-local-properties/","source_verification":"陈述与接口核对；完整证明未核验"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-gaifman"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-gaifman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gaifman — 无常量关系词汇上的 Gaifman 正规形式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0bddecd0c0bf21b\" href=\"?note=a0bddecd0c0bf21b\" title=\"29-df-gaifman-normal-form\">29-df-gaifman-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Historical notes, p.111, DjVu scan 126; Gaifman (1982), original publication abstract"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书历史引文及原始论文机构记录摘要；完整证明未核验"},{"key":"source_url","html":"<a href=\"https://cris.huji.ac.il/en/publications/on-local-and-non-local-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://cris.huji.ac.il/en/publications/on-local-and-non-local-properties/</a>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"陈述与接口核对；完整证明未核验"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\\geq1\">\\(a_i\\geq1\\)</span>，没有常量或函数符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 和满足关系见所列依赖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\)</span> 是基本局部句的布尔闭包。</li>\n<li>本条只取有限非空结构，不为关系符号附加内建线性序解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\quad(A\\models\\phi\\leftrightarrow A\\models\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\quad(A\\models\\phi\\leftrightarrow A\\models\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页 111、扫描页 126 在历史说明中引用 Gaifman 的局部性定理，没有在本书给出此正规形的完整证明。Gaifman 1982 的原始论文机构记录摘要明确陈述一阶句可化为局部基本句的布尔组合，见 <a href=\"https://cris.huji.ac.il/en/publications/on-local-and-non-local-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">On local and non-local properties</a>。本次核对的是原书引文、该原始论文摘要中的陈述及本库正规形接口，未核验原论文完整证明。原条在外层重新量化全部 Vocabulary，覆盖了假设之外的函数词汇；现固定到无常量纯关系词汇。局部化递归必须保持中心变量自由并避免捕获，详见定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-gaifman-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"a0bddecd0c0bf21b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-gaifman-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"a_i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\operatorname{GaifNF}_{\\tau}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\quad(A\\models\\phi\\leftrightarrow A\\models\\psi).","display":true}],"bytes":2110,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0bddecd0c0bf21b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本书印刷页111的历史段落只指向 Gaifman 的局部性论文，没有提供这里整个正规形定义与证明。本条完成的是定义接口；对应存在性定理及其来源限制见 [[29-thm-gaifman]]。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-gaifman-normal-form]]、[[29-thm-gaifman]] — Gaifman 范式与局部性"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-gaifman]]"}],"outgoing":["a0bddecd0c0bf21b","28e86a5f0243a0ae","711217f22972ffc0","4de8e0c8085801f5","3ee556c64b16809b"]}